Hi,
Our team has prepared a new TRRT build version 0.3.0106. It mainly contains major improvements for Custom Game mode with your own tracks and some other fixes.

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/31272526/d11c2f7990082a65ee2371dffa1661c7dbf49686.jpg[/img]

Here is the list of changes:
[olist]
    [*] We've added the leaderboards for Custom Game, so now you can see the other players' scores;
    [*] Every uploaded track at Custom Game will be saved to your tracklist and you'll need just to choose from menu any of them to play again;
    [*] The analysis for your own tracks at Custom Game became much faster;
    [*] Now you can see your position among all players at Leaderboard and the Top-3 rating for every level;
    [*] The Chakram (disc) mechanics was updated. From this version it kills every enemy immediately from the first throw;
    [*] It was fixed the performance bug at spawn of an enemy with green shield;
    [*] Some UX improvements;
[/olist]

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/31272526/ba5946ab33bda4eceb37eef47cd9012ba3f06963.jpg[/img]
